            "review_title": "Review at Sam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Alicia1010\nGeelong, Australia63 contributions\n0\nBest meal I had!!\nJul 2024 • Couples\nAn understated little place, just at the entrance/exit to Marble Mountain. We were just popping in for a drink but decided to have a bowl of the veg fried noodles. This was hands down the best meal I had in our whole two weeks in Vietnam. The lady who runs it was so lovely, gave us cold wipes to cool us down, brought drinks over immediately and got all the fans pointed to us (we must have looked hot!!)\nSupport this business, she’s super lovely and the food is amazing!!\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2024",
